{"title":"2013 AIME II Problems/Problem 14","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem_14\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 14</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#The_Pattern\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">The Pattern</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#The_Intuition\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">The Intuition</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#The_Proof\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">The Proof</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Generalized_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Generalized Solution</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_14\">Problem 14</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 14\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For positive integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" />, let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/b/c2be0fe8aa88793cf0feb0fd9a31204141671702.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(n, k)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"52\" height=\"18\" /> be the remainder when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> is divided by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" />, and for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/9/d/49d98ffe996c0f0d3b82b284cba2113439fefea9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n &gt; 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"46\" height=\"15\" /> let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/b/5bb90146a1db6e1c11470486fe8117739235f634.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$F(n) = \\max_{\\substack{1\\le k\\le \\frac{n}{2}}} f(n, k)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"165\" height=\"28\" />. Find the remainder when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/d/76dc6d11cc108b4c63e279c4815856ac831c2796.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sum_{n=20}^{100} F(n)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -23px\" width=\"76\" height=\"55\" /> is divided by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/e/6ee927e1332358c96c62c277441c907c4f51057f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"The_Pattern\">The Pattern</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: The Pattern\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>We can find that \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/0/3b0693dd361cc498522ff0be7624d5c8c10a3201.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20\\equiv 6 \\pmod{7}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"122\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/a/94a327c6951f1fb2ba562aed943c063e6e80d6b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$21\\equiv 5 \\pmod{8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"122\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/1/0817ff12c72b3b3b86bdcecd9aa263603d448034.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$22\\equiv 6 \\pmod{8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"122\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/b/94b5f62b3a8437490dc692721bb56f6136be0ea6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$23\\equiv 7 \\pmod{8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"122\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/9/6d968e72aa0dfe082fce6a47b6af5396c3075305.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$24\\equiv 6 \\pmod{9}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"122\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/e/77e9e8f9e21600135ec79fe383e6a454b1dedbe4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$25\\equiv 7 \\pmod{9}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"122\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/c/aace4ab097032fd1f90f9b6963432710333876af.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$26\\equiv 8 \\pmod{9}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"126\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>Observing these and we can find that the reminders are in groups of three continuous integers, considering this is true, and we get\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/9/f891fef145893e0d9e4a0d8008421b92375703d2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$99\\equiv 31 \\pmod{34}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"140\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/e/fde94e18c7dce9e982df3838c3cd46f447a07f73.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100\\equiv 32 \\pmod{34}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"149\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>So the sum is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/1/d813dd7f2b73a040bb1b98407922fddb1d089fb6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6+3\\times(6+...+31)+31+32=1512$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"304\" height=\"18\" />,it is also 17+20+23+...+95, so the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/7/4575d9e1ae3506c2a68367b3039c89452b385980.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{512}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"39\" height=\"23\" />.\nBy: Kris17\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"The_Intuition\">The Intuition</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: The Intuition\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>First, let's see what happens if we remove a restriction. Let's define <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/7/a1723e8014c07d67a4aad9d06d8580ab010227fc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$G(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"41\" height=\"20\" /> as\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/3/4c354c8c7e1fedfd05e8a0a70346c93c1437ec7d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$G(x):=\\max_{\\substack{1\\le k}} f(n, k)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"157\" height=\"27\" />\n</p><p>Now, if you set <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> as any number greater than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />, you get n, obviously the maximum possible. That's too much freedom; let's restrict it a bit. Hence <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/4/df4e0c1b626e2abd358c8aa60271a28778f866e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$H(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"39\" height=\"18\" /> is defined as\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/e/e9e913d90cb2a3d4988a0f8eaa8c8876cf83716d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$H(x):=\\max_{\\substack{1\\le k\\le n}} f(n, k)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"169\" height=\"27\" />\n</p><p>Now, after some thought, we find that if we set <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/4/ff4caa61c7f7dcef831be92fae4f9f26bbb6ff48.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k=\\lfloor \\frac{n}{2} \\rfloor+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"95\" height=\"33\" /> we get a remainder of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/f/67fae71208b764075e608863d885d0b929a0a089.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\lfloor \\frac{n-1}{2} \\rfloor$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"59\" height=\"37\" />, the max possible. Once we have gotten this far, it is easy to see that the original equation, \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/b/5bb90146a1db6e1c11470486fe8117739235f634.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$F(n) = \\max_{\\substack{1\\le k\\le \\frac{n}{2}}} f(n, k)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"165\" height=\"28\" />\n</p><p>has a solution with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/7/2e7a4d29c5e6750e34e3b1cc310fe59a9b93a4dc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k=\\lfloor \\frac{n}{3} \\rfloor+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"95\" height=\"33\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/2/832b6034258cd1ea4fe08042ce01f04d11294a22.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$W^5$\" width=\"25\" height=\"15\" />~Rowechen\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"The_Proof\">The Proof</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: The Proof\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>The solution presented above does not prove why <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/e/8/de8fdaa56ea5a8940d4bba79faa9e3dea0f6bf7c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$F(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"37\" height=\"18\" /> is found by dividing <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. Indeed, that is the case, as rigorously shown below.\n</p><p>Consider the case where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/5/8254ae828d437a6211d4f410d21393ec9f6a071a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 3k$\" width=\"53\" height=\"12\" />. We shall prove that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/f/76f738b553857b4a2fc6e429bc4827af1845426d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$F(x) = f(x, k+1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"146\" height=\"18\" />.\nFor all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/b/8cbeb9c5180ed7fa528565c1ebaa0909db3ddc7a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x/2\\ge n &gt; k+1, x = 2n + q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"225\" height=\"20\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/c/3ac23afd8d64dd51f7a43ceedd88d11f0590e4f0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0\\le q&lt; n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"79\" height=\"17\" />. This is because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/7/41716b400a2258b29bcff4bf60e1137e5577ab58.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x &lt; 3k + 3 &lt; 3n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"131\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/6/ed6499ae41790d98f8088c7c573cf77809680058.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x \\ge 2n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"54\" height=\"14\" />. Also, as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> increases, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/1/0615acc3725de21025457e7d6f7694dab8e2f758.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> decreases. Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/e/6de013f41455c9f2afb36ec0712ad160f867a5c0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q = f(x, n) &lt; f(x, k+1) = k - 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"261\" height=\"18\" /> for all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/1/191f056f40a52b7e718eb5c7af43c0a768163f12.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n &gt; k+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"75\" height=\"14\" />.\nConsider all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/f/51f1bb8f8afe401a3643b604365188d20380bd71.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n &lt; k+1. f(x, k) = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"168\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/5/7/9577152da9cad6139c56216c2fdb058e3993f051.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x, k-1) = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"117\" height=\"18\" />. Also, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/2/b02195eb3edca43b9e53a698966ce0f5ef671c73.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0 &lt; f(x, k-2) &lt; k-2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"183\" height=\"18\" />. Thus, for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/c/e2c68a67e1e00f1f4311dc58ddfa760333fea1fa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k &gt; 5, f(x, k+1) &gt; f(x, n)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"213\" height=\"18\" /> for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/b/2bbc6528b2b6eafd99103e696555d11939924dc5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n &lt; k+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"75\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>Similar proofs apply for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/2/252ab94d57a73a8a09ef2bdd7624a81278dac14d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 3k + 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"84\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/4/8241190e0fa874060048d1f192ab4e237c7d64f3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 3k + 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"84\" height=\"14\" />. The reader should feel free to derive these proofs themself.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Generalized_Solution\">Generalized Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Generalized Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/6/196fc8fc6e48db556ed7f9fccc26b45d07a09924.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Lemma:$\" width=\"71\" height=\"12\" /> Highest remainder when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> is divided by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/b/b9bdc6a84e8e9d8f3d57c063410b286a11073b80.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1\\leq k\\leq n/2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"96\" height=\"18\" /> is obtained for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/3/a23cf09fd9b974976ef15b9ecc0f03b0e292c226.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k_0 = (n + (3 - n \\pmod{3}))/3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"237\" height=\"20\" /> and the remainder thus obtained is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/3/c231a3ce645279adfa30bdc9fd7aa799d2f9197b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(n - k_0*2) = [(n - 6)/3 + (2/3)*n \\pmod{3}]$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"361\" height=\"18\" />. \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/2/962773912e13b3e88f5e7058c2e8e736f88340cf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Note:$\" width=\"49\" height=\"12\" /> This is the second highest remainder when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> is divided by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/d/5/4d5d6afdb30595e16e1700beba0d8f32a3d2db6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1\\leq k\\leq n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"78\" height=\"15\" /> and the highest remainder occurs when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> is divided by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/0/1a073fc7449eda52c0ddb50700c95d6887657c17.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k_M$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"23\" height=\"15\" /> = <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/5/9751a9feb47425ab2a6a9843788db1b84e9df5d1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(n+1)/2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"73\" height=\"18\" /> for odd <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> and  <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/0/1a073fc7449eda52c0ddb50700c95d6887657c17.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k_M$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"23\" height=\"15\" /> = <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/5/7656f4d4a554a204acff087664f5beb99e2ff857.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(n+2)/2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"73\" height=\"18\" /> for even <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />.\n</p><p>Using the lemma above:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/e/b/1ebded691d00c2add1869cca8b93b5abd0e98177.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sum\\limits_{n=20}^{100} F(n) = \\sum\\limits_{n=20}^{100} [(n - 6)/3 + (2/3)*n \\pmod{3}]$\" style=\"vertical-align: -20px\" width=\"376\" height=\"50\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/4/4845d0a0e6c2081a2ca5cf536918ca7bbc1003e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$= [(120*81/2)/3 - 2*81 + (2/3)*81] = 1512$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"368\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>So the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/7/4575d9e1ae3506c2a68367b3039c89452b385980.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{512}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"39\" height=\"23\" />\n</p><p>Proof of Lemma: It is similar to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/2/e32b28b961e9eecb76b4ac97a1a351a2154d29ce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$The Proof$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"83\" height=\"16\" /> stated above. \n</p><p>Kris17\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/c/6bc049c0a6cd4855d34dba74eb723b69304f1b70.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(n,k)=r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"89\" height=\"20\" />, and we set the quotient <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/5/1d532b0c5d15ac8defedaedb905ab6b1c9756ac3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q=\\left\\lfloor\\frac{n}{k}\\right\\rfloor\\ge 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"102\" height=\"35\" />. It follows that\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/0/6a0da0eb75f2eb75cf5ee0be7bfbd288743dd113.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[r=n-qk\\]\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\nWe see that\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/1/581776c41fa31154c08adf8b22bdb808e709cc45.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[q\\le \\frac{n}{k} &lt; q+1\\]\" width=\"110\" height=\"32\" />\nOr\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/4/184ca5a79e921ae93e9978c1fc867d22459ffb6c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{n}{q+1}&lt; k\\le\\frac{n}{q}\\]\" width=\"114\" height=\"36\" />\nMinimizing <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> yields a greater value for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/5/b55ca7a0aa88ab7d58f4fc035317fdac39b17861.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />. Hence, taking <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/d/c5db4f34111cab16326524590fe94f2cd0c6425f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k=\\left\\lfloor\\frac{n}{q+1}\\right\\rfloor+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"132\" height=\"45\" />,\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/d/f7d7e0dc650a59e0ecdc27eb3ae95096f6e3f434.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[r=n-q\\left\\lfloor\\frac{n}{q+1}\\right\\rfloor-q\\]\" width=\"173\" height=\"43\" />\nWhen <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/4/2249017892bda0490d89aa6d997b953b070b1ba1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"41\" height=\"15\" />:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/f/dffbdfaeb946d91959570d3b447c22a1c6b74be5.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[r=n-2\\left\\lfloor\\frac{n}{3}\\right\\rfloor-2 \\ge \\frac{n}{3}-2\\]\" width=\"212\" height=\"33\" />\nSince <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/4/a343ec193a0b0e89d7de79bedb09a9eb564260ea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left\\lfloor\\frac{n}{q+1}\\right\\rfloor\\ge \\frac{n}{q+1}-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"166\" height=\"45\" />, comparing to the case when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/3/8d3333281a5b728b6612bd51d871291de0751d07.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q\\ge 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"44\" height=\"17\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/7/f675b5e594db8bff1279a0c3b186dc3248ad96cd.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[r\\le \\frac{n}{q+1}\\le \\frac{n}{4}\\]\" width=\"113\" height=\"36\" />\nThus, the maximal of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/e/c8efe5bd02d1fbcd43c1139ab069c8a61372b698.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r=n-2\\left\\lfloor\\frac{n}{3}\\right\\rfloor-2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"145\" height=\"35\" /> holds when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/c/d8cfbdbaff2acb13ce8f1483ea3d27695f1f21c4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q=2,n\\ge 24$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"105\" height=\"17\" />. Checking the cases for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/8/eb8bad29bce2e0595b921d37338371e633b33451.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=20,21,22,23$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"134\" height=\"17\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/4/2249017892bda0490d89aa6d997b953b070b1ba1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"41\" height=\"15\" /> also gives the maximal.\n</p><p>For <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/0/0b0bf49bb32078e261c85e2417e018761559bd16.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n\\ge 20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"55\" height=\"16\" />, we have\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/1/7b135a9f6d5a1455d5460654e0a04ea591a78e8c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[F(n)=n-2\\left\\lfloor\\frac{n}{3}\\right\\rfloor-2\\]\" width=\"172\" height=\"33\" />\nComputing the summation:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/d/0/4d0fdd7d809931606c4197304b57618484890304.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sum_{n=20}^{100}F(n)=\\left(\\sum_{n=20}^{100}n\\right)-\\left(2\\sum_{n=20}^{100}\\left\\lfloor\\frac{n}{3}\\right\\rfloor\\right)-\\sum_{n=20}^{100}2\\]\" width=\"367\" height=\"53\" />\nWe see that\n\\begin{align*}\n\\sum_{n=20}^{100}\\left\\lfloor\\frac{n}{3}\\right\\rfloor&amp;=\\sum_{k=7}^{33}\\left\\lfloor\\frac{3k-1}{3}\\right\\rfloor+\\sum_{k=7}^{33}\\left\\lfloor\\frac{3k}{3}\\right\\rfloor+\\sum_{k=7}^{33}\\left\\lfloor\\frac{3k+1}{3}\\right\\rfloor\\\\\n&amp;=\\sum_{k=7}^{33}(k-1)+\\sum_{k=7}^{33}k+\\sum_{k=7}^{33}k\\\\\n&amp;=\\sum_{k=7}^{33}3k-1\\\\\n&amp;=1593\n\\end{align*}\nTherefore,\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/2/20262ad384fa18fed31ed3e14c34cc15a54b401e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sum_{n=20}^{100}F(n)=4860-3186-162=1512\\]\" width=\"301\" height=\"50\" />\nThe requested answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/7/4575d9e1ae3506c2a68367b3039c89452b385980.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{512}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"39\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p><p>~Pieandpi31415926535897932\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/mQ4_1dp8Wm8?si=Ae5HAc0cZQAjdtWl\">https://youtu.be/mQ4_1dp8Wm8?si=Ae5HAc0cZQAjdtWl</a>\n</p><p>~MathProblemSolvingSkills.com\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AIME_II\" title=\"2013 AIME II\">2013 AIME II</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AIME_II_Problems\" title=\"2013 AIME II Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AIME_II_Answer_Key\" title=\"2013 AIME II Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=45&amp;year=2013\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2013 AIME II Problems/Problem 13\">Problem 13</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2013 AIME II Problems/Problem 15\">Problem 15</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2013 AIME II Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2013 AIME II Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2013 AIME II Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2013 AIME II Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2013 AIME II Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2013 AIME II Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2013 AIME II Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2013 AIME II Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2013 AIME II Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2013 AIME II Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2013 AIME II Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2013 AIME II Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2013 AIME II Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2013 AIME II Problems/Problem 15\">15</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AIME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AIME Problems and Solutions\"> All AIME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"m